# Any weapon (change m6-any-weapon, SPEC 4.9): every real player knows every weapon type and Shield.
# The test character is a Human Warrior: stock MoP warriors can't use wands, so the Fire Wand (5069, level 7) shows it.

> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 20 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
~ 4000
> .arpg test weapons Arpgtest 5069
? ok proficiencies=15/15 dualwield=\d applies=1 added=\d+ item=5069 canuse=0\b
# A shield too (equip result 0 = can equip).
> .arpg test weapons Arpgtest 1201
? proficiencies=15/15 .* canuse=0\b

# Feature off: no longer applies (nothing is taken away until the next login).
> .arpg config set Arpg.AnyWeapon.Enabled 0
? ok
> .arpg test weapons Arpgtest
? applies=0 added=0\b
> .arpg config set Arpg.AnyWeapon.Enabled 1
? ok
